  "caption": "In Swedish, a turtle is a sköldpadda: a sköld (shield) plus a padda (toad). Once you see it, you can't unsee it.\n\nSwedish builds a lot of words by gluing simple ones together, so many of them explain themselves. A hippo is a flodhäst (river horse) and a bat is a fladdermus (flutter mouse).\n\nWhich one is your favourite?",
